# SOC2 Type II continuous-evidencing case study (v26.7.13 Stage 3) -- Q1
# quarterly re-test residue for the Operating Effectiveness Testing socket.
#
# This is a real F09 MFW Growth `ResidueState` source: a self-contained
# PDDL8 domain+problem pair (both `ceng:pddlDomain` and `ceng:pddlProblem`
# in ONE fixture, unlike the base 10-phase audit-cycle fragments which
# split domain/problem across files) -- growth residues are independent
# bounded continuation goals, never merged with the base cycle's domain.
# `crate::bench::soc2_growth::load_residue` admits this file through the
# SAME real `pipeline::import_artifacts` oxigraph path the base cycle uses.
#
# COMPLIANCE-OVERCLAIM FENCE: the effect below is "quarterly-evidence-
# closed-q1" -- evidence closure, never "compliant" or "opinion-issued".
# See packs/soc2-audit-pack/ontology.ttl for the full fence disclosure this
# growth cycle inherits.
@prefix ceng:    <urn:chatman:engine#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

_:artifact
    skos:notation "OE-TESTING-GROWTH-Q1" ;
    dcterms:description "Q1 quarterly operating-effectiveness re-test residue: draws a fresh quarterly sample and closes Q1's evidence for the 12-month Type II observation period."@en ;
    ceng:pddlDomain """
(define (domain arclight-soc2-oe-quarterly-retest-q1)
  (:requirements :strips)
  (:predicates
    (quarterly-sample-drawn-q1 ?x)
    (quarterly-evidence-closed-q1 ?x))
  (:action retest-operating-effectiveness-q1
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (quarterly-sample-drawn-q1 ?x))
    :effect (and (quarterly-evidence-closed-q1 ?x))))
""" ;
    ceng:pddlProblem """
(define (problem arclight-soc2-oe-quarterly-retest-q1-p)
  (:domain arclight-soc2-oe-quarterly-retest-q1)
  (:objects arclight)
  (:init (quarterly-sample-drawn-q1 arclight))
  (:goal (and (quarterly-evidence-closed-q1 arclight))))
""" .
